{"id":"l8eyef4lvkku2m77665yvhumg","title":"蝗虫受伤引发的信号传导如何协调免疫与同类相食","originalTitle":"Injury-induced signalling coordinates immunity and cannibalism in locusts","summary":"蝗虫受伤后释放的挥发性肉桂酚具有双重作用：在轻微损伤时增强个体生存能力，当损伤程度超过阈值时反而吸引同类捕食。该研究通过建立蝗虫损伤模型，首次系统揭示化学信号在协调免疫应答与群体行为中的关键调控机制。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Nature"},"links":{"original":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11297-7"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T17:54:38.780Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T17:54:38.780Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":55,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"60bf0a08-3aa8-43b2-9242-57f39adb1bf7","title":"蝗虫化学信号双重作用机制获Nature发表"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Weikang Han","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"60bf0a08-3aa8-43b2-9242-57f39adb1bf7","title":"蝗虫化学信号双重作用机制获Nature发表"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f36ZAKfda_30","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}